<title>VENEZUELA: Envases yr net rises to 1.4 bln bolivars.</title>
<headline>Envases yr net rises to 1.4 bln bolivars.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net 1.357 billion bolivars vs 920.3 million bolivars</p>
<p>Shr 5.02 bolivar vs 3.65 bolivar</p>
<p>Revs 24.950 billion bolivars vs 24.549 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Period ending 31 Aug, 1996</p>
<p>Results are consolidated and inflation adjusted apart from the earnings per share</p>
<p>Envasas Venezolanos SA manufactures containers for food and beverage industries</p>
<p>It is the main supplier to Coca-Cola Inc in Venezuela</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
